.TH DANBY-JOGGINGCOMPANION 1
.SH NAME
danby-joggingcompanion \- coupled pacing of two runners
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/joggingcompanion
.SH MODEL
Each runner relaxes toward a chosen pace against drag.  The companion also
responds to error from the desired separation, producing convergence or
oscillatory catch-up according to response and coupling.
.SH DISPLAY
Two linked figures show separation; leader speed and separation are plotted.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/joggingcompanion.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
